# The AgOpenWeb build a tagged HAT release ships (release.yml): its version as the app stamps it
# (<version>+<commit>, AgOpenWeb.Desktop.dll). AgOpenWeb's Beta must be this build when the tag is
# pushed, so a release carries the app it was tested with. Nightlies take the Beta as it is.
